  "info": {
    "title": "OPC UA Specification Publisher",
    "version": "1.0.32",
    "description": "Builds an OPC UA companion specification from markdown plus a UANodeSet into NISO STS 1.2 Extended XML, and renders a browsable markdown edition from it. Cross-platform - runs on Windows, macOS and Linux, and needs no Microsoft Office. Install with: dotnet tool install --global OPCFoundation.Opc.Ua.SpecificationPublisher. Invoke as Opc.Ua.SpecificationPublisher."
  },
